  - '|The village is burning. The great bell has stopped.'
  - Ilyan|Mira...? Mira! Where are you?
  - '|The lantern is warm in his hands. Something tall and dark rises out of his
    shadow.'
  - Ilyan|Stay away from me! ...Why won't it hurt me?
